    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skipper, Dipper, and Mable are back! Having successfully crossed the Crystalline Sea in their last Great Adventure, they are ready for new challenges, harder puzzles and new obstacles - are you ready? Welcome to Skipper2: Hijinks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skipper2 is a fun, challenging, relaxing lowpoly puzzle game with over 30 levels to bend your mind and challenge your problem solving ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skipper2's controls are simple and the game's difficulty has an approachable learning curve making puzzlers of all abilities able to easily dive into the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular (free!) puzzle packs will drop for the game, with packs already scheduled for November 6th, December 28th, and January 19th. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skipper2 brings you </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique challenges across 25+ puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SteamDeck Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most puzzles can be solved in more than one way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular drops of new puzzles for free</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard and Gamepad controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An environment as unique as it is relaxing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A soothing sound track and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of Steam Achievements</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skipper, Dipper, and Mable are back! Having successfully crossed the Crystalline Sea in their last Great Adventure, they are ready for new challenges, harder puzzles and new obstacles - are you ready? Welcome to Skipper2: Hijinks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skipper2 is a fun, challenging, relaxing lowpoly puzzle game with over 30 levels to bend your mind and challenge your problem solving ability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Skipper2's controls are simple and the game's difficulty has an approachable learning curve making puzzlers of all abilities able to easily dive into the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular (free!) puzzle packs will drop for the game, with packs already scheduled for November 6th, December 28th, and January 19th. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Skipper2 brings you </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique challenges across 25+ puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">SteamDeck Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most puzzles can be solved in more than one way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Regular drops of new puzzles for free</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard and Gamepad controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An environment as unique as it is relaxing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A soothing sound track and effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lots of Steam Achievements</p></li></ul>",
